  "details": "Currently, tool authors using the IVRCSDKPreprocessAvatarCallback have to each implement their own unique mechanisms for testing and previewing results in play mode. These then can result in conflicts (such as what happened recently with Modular Avatar and VRCFury). Having an officially-blessed mechanism for testing avatar hooks in play mode would be very helpful to avoid these kinds of conflicts between tools.",
